          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Base rates in Indian Rupees (₹) as notified by Department of Posts, Government of India.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-flex self-start sm:self-auto items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-semibold border border-emerald-200">
          ✓ Verified 2026 Tariff
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3.5 border-b">Weight Bracket</th>
              <th class="p-3.5 border-b">Local (Same City)</th>
              <th class="p-3.5 border-b">Up to 200 km</th>
              <th class="p-3.5 border-b">201 to 1,000 km</th>
              <th class="p-3.5 border-b">1,001 to 2,000 km</th>
              <th class="p-3.5 border-b">Above 2,000 km</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-slate-800">
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition-colors">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">Up to 50 grams</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-brand-600">₹15</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹35</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹35</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹35</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹35</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition-colors">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">51 to 200 grams</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-brand-600">₹25</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹35</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹40</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹60</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹70</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition-colors">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">201 to 500 grams</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-brand-600">₹30</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹50</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹60</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹70</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold">₹80</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-brand-50/40 hover:bg-brand-50/70 transition-colors">
              <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-slate-900">
                Additional 500g <span class="block text-[11px] font-normal text-slate-500">(up to 35 kg maximum)</span>
              </td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-brand-700">+₹10</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-700">+₹15</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-700">+₹30</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-700">+₹40</td>
              <td class="p-3.5 font-semibold text-slate-700">+₹50</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- GST Note Callout -->
      <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-900 text-xs leading-relaxed flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-base">📌</span>
        <div>
          <strong class="font-semibold">Note on GST & Additional Services:</strong> All base rates shown above are subject to an additional <strong>18% Goods and Services Tax (GST)</strong>. Proof of Delivery (POD) can be requested for an extra charge of <strong>₹10 per article</strong>.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Comprehensive Calculated Rates with 18% GST Included (For Instant Reference) -->
    <section class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Final Speed Post Charges (With 18% GST Included)</h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">Actual total payable amount at the post office counter for standard weights.</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 border-b">Weight</th>
              <th class="p-3 border-b">Local (Same City)</th>
              <th class="p-3 border-b">Up to 200 km</th>
              <th class="p-3 border-b">201 to 1,000 km</th>
              <th class="p-3 border-b">1,001 to 2,000 km</th>
              <th class="p-3 border-b">Above 2,000 km</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-slate-800">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">50 grams (Document/Letter)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-brand-600 font-bold">₹17.70</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹41.30</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹41.30</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹41.30</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹41.30</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50/50">
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">100 grams</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-brand-600 font-bold">₹29.50</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹41.30</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹47.20</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹70.80</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹82.60</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">250 grams</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-brand-600 font-bold">₹35.40</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹59.00</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹70.80</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹82.60</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹94.40</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50/50">
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">500 grams (Half kg parcel)</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-brand-600 font-bold">₹35.40</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹59.00</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹70.80</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹82.60</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹94.40</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">1 kg parcel</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-brand-600 font-bold">₹47.20</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹76.70</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹106.20</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹129.80</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹153.40</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-slate-50/50">
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">2 kg parcel</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-brand-600 font-bold">₹70.80</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹112.10</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹177.00</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹224.20</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹271.40</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold">5 kg parcel</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-brand-600 font-bold">₹141.60</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹218.30</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹389.40</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹507.40</td>
              <td class="p-3">₹625.40</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 text-center">
        <a 
          href="/speed-post-calculator" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 hover:underline"
        >
          <span>Need custom weight or PIN-to-PIN calculations? Open the interactive Speed Post Calculator</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Speed Post Delivery Time Standards (Norms) -->
    <section class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Speed Post Delivery Timelines (Citizen Charter Norms)</h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">Standard transit times established under India Post service standards.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xl">🏙️</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Local Delivery</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600 mt-2">1 – 2 Days</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Within the same municipality, city, or delivery PIN circle.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xl">✈️</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Metro to Metro</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600 mt-2">1 – 3 Days</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Between Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Chennai, Kolkata, and Hyderabad.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xl">🏛️</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">State Capital to Capital</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600 mt-2">2 – 4 Days</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Transit between major state capitals across India.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xl">🚚</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Same State (District to District)</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600 mt-2">2 – 4 Days</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Delivery between different districts in the same state.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xl">🗺️</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Rest of the Country</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-black text-brand-600 mt-2">4 – 6 Days</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Inter-state transit and deliveries to remote or hill regions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xl">🛡️</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm">Compensation for Delay</h3>
          </div>
